    description: "Dart: the hashed signature text keeps some parameter names, keeps inner names of function-typed parameters, and loses a group's closing bracket.\n\nREPRO: normalize_dart_signature(\"(int a, [int c = ..., String? d])\") gives \"(int,[int c, String?)\" - the name c survives (renaming it moves the id) and the ] is lost. Existing before PR 3's layout fix; found by PR 3 agent 7 (~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/pr3/agent7/RESULTS.md R7). Agent 7 also notes the Dart text leaves a named group's { open, so its commas read as commas inside a type. Fixing it moves Dart typed ids, so it needs a stable-id bump."  # d48a
